Sha384</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Sha512oSha512\"><code>Sha512oSha512</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">类型函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L13\">第 13 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>两个哈希函数的复合 H1 o H2，其 API 与普通哈希函数相同。</p>\n<p>级联哈希的安全级别不会超过其中最弱函数的安全级别。</p>\n<p>不过，SHA-256 等 Merkle–Damgård 构造易受长度扩展攻击，\n在某些条件下，无需知道 <code>x</code> 即可高效计算 <code>H(x||e)</code>。\n复合两个哈希函数是抵御此类攻击的常见方式。</p>\n<p>SHA-3、BLAKE2、BLAKE3 等现代哈希函数无需如此处理。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">Composition</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> H1: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>, <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> H2: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>H1: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>H2: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>H1: H1</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>H2: H2</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\"><code>Self</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.digest_length\"><code>digest_length</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.block_length\"><code>block_length</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.Options\"><code>Options</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.init\"><code>init</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.hash\"><code>hash</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.update\"><code>update</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.final\"><code>final</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.finalResult\"><code>finalResult</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.block_length\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.block_length</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L23\">第 23 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>块长度，单位为字节。</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.digest_length\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.digest_length</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L21\">第 21 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>哈希输出的长度，单位为字节。</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.final\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.final</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L51\">第 51 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>计算累积内容的最终哈希：H1(H2(b))。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">final</span>(d: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\">Self</a>, out: *[<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.digest_length\">digest_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>d: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\">Self</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>out: *[<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.digest_length\">digest_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.finalResult\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.finalResult</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L58\">第 58 行</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">finalResult</span>(d: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\">Self</a>) [<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.digest_length\">digest_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>d: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\">Self</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.hash\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.hash</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L39\">第 39 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>计算 H1(H2(b))。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"t