n.Composition.Options</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L26\">第 26 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>两种哈希算法的选项。</p>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>H1: H1.Options = .{}</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>H1 的选项。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>H2: H2.Options = .{}</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>H2 的选项。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.Self\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.Self</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L15\">第 15 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\"><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.update\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition.update</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L46\">第 46 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>向哈希添加内容。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">update</span>(d: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\">Self</a>, b: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>d: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hash_composition/#std.crypto.hash_composition.Composition\">Self</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>b: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.hash_composition.sha2\"><h3><code>std.crypto.hash_composition.sh